OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister says NHS waits over
OL,4,Atwo years will be eradicated within
OL,5,Ayear
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Plaid Cymru Welsh government will
OL,8,Fget the longest waits in the NHS down
OL,9,Fto zero in "less than a year", the
OL,10,Ffirst minister has pledged.
OL,12,FSince it entered government Plaid
OL,13,Fministers have promised to rapidly
OL,14,Feradicate waits of two years or more
OL,15,Fwithin a "matter of months", although
OL,16,Fthey have never given a precise date.
OL,18,FOn Tuesday, Rhun ap Iorwerth suggested
OL,19,Fit would be achieved by before
OL,20,FSeptember 2027 at the latest.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
